msgid "Features:"
msgstr "新功能："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:22
msgid ""
"**Compound geometry models multi-part bodies.** Real platforms are rarely a "
"single primitive. A shape can now be composed of fixed circle, rectangle, "
"and polygon parts and behaves as one body everywhere: collision, lidar, "
"rendering, and goals. ([#350](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/350))"
msgstr ""
"**复合几何体可建模多部件刚体。** "
"真实平台很少是单一图元。现在可以用固定的圆、矩形和多边形部件组合出一个形状，并在碰撞、激光雷达、渲染和目标中作为一个整体使用。([#350](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/350))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:23
msgid ""
"**An external system can own the state update.** In co-simulation or "
"hardware-in-the-loop setups another simulator or middleware already computes"
" the next states; with `step_mode: \"external\"` IR-SIM stops integrating on"
" its own and instead keeps geometry, sensors, collisions, and the clock in "
"sync with the states the caller sets. ([#354](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/354))"
msgstr ""
"**外部系统可以接管状态更新。** 在联合仿真或硬件在环场景中，外部仿真器或中间件已经算出了下一时刻状态；使用 `step_mode: "
"\"external\"` 时 IR-SIM "
"不再自行积分，而是让几何、传感器、碰撞和时钟与调用方设置的状态保持同步。([#354](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/354))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:24
msgid ""
"**ROS-style messages exchange simulation state.** Bridging IR-SIM to ROS or "
"to another simulator used to need custom glue; `env.get_msg()` / "
"`env.receive_msg()` provide dependency-free snapshots and odometry updates, "
"so a bridge becomes a few lines of code. "
"([#355](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/355))"
msgstr ""
"**ROS 风格消息用于交换仿真状态。** 以前将 IR-SIM 接入 ROS 或其他仿真器需要自写胶水代码；`env.get_msg()` / "
"`env.receive_msg()` "
"提供不依赖第三方库的快照与里程计更新，桥接只需几行代码。([#355](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/355))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:25
msgid ""
"**YAML gets a `custom` section.** Experiment parameters - reward weights, "
"safety margins, planner settings - can live next to the scenario that uses "
"them and be read back via `env.config[\"custom\"]`, instead of maintaining a"
" second configuration file. ([#359](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/359))"
msgstr ""
"**YAML 新增 `custom` 段。** 实验参数——奖励权重、安全裕度、规划器设置——可以与使用它们的场景放在一起，通过 "
"`env.config[\"custom\"]` "
"读取，而无需再维护第二个配置文件。([#359](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/359))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:26
msgid ""
"**Headless mode skips the figure entirely.** Batch reinforcement-learning "
"training creates thousands of environments that never draw; `irsim.make(...,"
" headless=True)` builds no figure, window, or input devices and leaves the "
"Matplotlib backend alone, so parallel workers stay off the display stack and"
" environment creation is several times cheaper (see the table above). "
"`disable_all_plot` stays as an alias. ([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/362))"
msgstr ""
"**无头模式完全不创建图形。** 批量强化学习训练会创建成千上万个从不绘图的环境；`irsim.make(..., headless=True)` "
"不创建图形、窗口和输入设备，也不改动 Matplotlib "
"后端，并行进程完全不接触显示栈，创建环境的开销也大幅降低（见上表）。`disable_all_plot` "
"保留为别名。([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/362))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Custom kinematics models take their own YAML parameters.** Research models"
" - a first-order lag, a slip model - need their own constants; every extra "
"key under `kinematics:` now reaches the registered handler's `__init__`, so "
"a custom model is configured from the scenario exactly like a built-in one, "
"for example `kinematics: {name: lag, tau: 0.5}`. "
"([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/362))"
msgstr ""
"**自定义运动学模型可携带自己的 YAML 参数。** 研究用模型——一阶惯性、打滑模型——需要自己的常数；`kinematics:` "
"下的所有额外键现在都会传入已注册处理器的 `__init__`，自定义模型可以像内置模型一样直接在场景中配置，例如 `kinematics: "
"{name: lag, tau: 0.5}`。([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/362))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:28
msgid ""
"**Random numbers are per environment.** Vectorized training runs many "
"environments in one process, and results should not depend on how they "
"interleave; an environment created with `seed=` owns its generator for scene"
" sampling, resets, and noise, so each run is reproducible on its own. "
"Unseeded environments share the default generator as before. "
"([#365](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/365))"
msgstr ""
"**随机数按环境隔离。** 向量化训练在一个进程中运行多个环境，结果不应取决于它们的交错顺序；使用 `seed=` "
"创建的环境拥有自己的生成器，用于场景采样、重置和噪声，每次运行都可独立复现。未设种子的环境仍与以前一样共享默认生成器。([#365](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/365))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:29
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:74
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:100
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:119
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:136
msgid "Performance:"
msgstr "性能："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:30
msgid ""
"**2D lidar ray casting is rewritten.** The GEOS overlay operations are "
"replaced by one vectorized ray caster shared by `Lidar2D` and `FMCWLidar2D`:"
" scans are about 4.6-25x faster with range errors at machine precision, and "
"a scan taken from inside an obstacle no longer freezes. "
"([#353](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/353))"
msgstr ""
"**2D 激光雷达射线投射已重写。** GEOS 叠加运算被 `Lidar2D` 与 `FMCWLidar2D` 共享的向量化射线投射取代：扫描约快 "
"4.6-25 倍且距离误差在机器精度量级，从障碍物内部发出的扫描也不再冻结。([#353](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/353))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:31
msgid ""
"**RVO candidate evaluation is vectorized.** The per-candidate Python loop "
"scaled with robots x neighbors x candidates; it is now array math over all "
"candidates and modes (`rvo`, `hrvo`, `vo`), so 16 RVO robots step in 2.2 ms "
"instead of 37 ms and the gain grows with the crowd. "
"([#366](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/366))"
msgstr ""
"**RVO 候选速度评估已向量化。** 逐候选的 Python 循环开销随 机器人数 x 邻居数 x 候选数 "
"增长；现在对所有候选和模式（`rvo`、`hrvo`、`vo`）统一用数组运算，16 个 RVO 机器人每步从 37 ms 降到 2.2 "
"ms，且机器人越多收益越大。([#366](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/366))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:32
msgid ""
"**Per-object per-step overhead is cut.** The geometry radius is cached, "
"`geometry_transform` goes through `shapely.transform`, validity needs no "
"per-step GEOS check, the goal is converted once per goal instead of at every"
" read, and the acceleration window is skipped when `acce` is unbounded, "
"giving plain crowds a steady ~1.6x. ([#366](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/366))"
msgstr ""
"**逐对象逐步开销被削减。** 缓存几何半径、`geometry_transform` 改用 `shapely.transform`、有效性不再每步做 "
"GEOS 检查、目标每次更换只转换一次而不是每次读取都转换、`acce` 无界时跳过加速度窗口，普通机器人群获得稳定约 1.6 "
"倍加速。([#366](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/366))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:33
msgid ""
"**The collision query is batched.** One spatial query of the STRtree plus "
"one vectorized `intersects` replaces a query-and-test per object; map "
"objects keep their own occupancy test. ([#366](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/366))"
msgstr ""
"**碰撞查询已批量化。** 一次 STRtree 空间查询加一次向量化 `intersects` "
"取代了每个对象各自的查询与检测；地图对象保留自己的占据检测。([#366](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/366))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:34
msgid ""
"**pynput is imported lazily.** It loads only when a pynput keyboard "
"controller is created, saving about 85 ms of import time per process. "
"([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/362))"
msgstr ""
"**pynput 改为按需导入。** 仅在创建 pynput 键盘控制器时才加载，每个进程节省约 85 "
"毫秒导入时间。([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/362))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:35
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:54
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:77
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:122
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:141
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:158
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:173
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:195
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:219
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:242
msgid "Fix:"
msgstr "修复："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:36
msgid ""
"**Omni robots are commanded in the frame they are steered in.** ORCA, RVO, "
"and SFM plan in the world frame, but the velocity was passed on unchanged, "
"so a robot facing away from its goal drove away from it; the velocity is now"
" transformed into the robot's own frame before it is applied. "
"([#357](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/357))"
msgstr ""
"**全向机器人在其被操控的坐标系中接收指令。** ORCA、RVO 和 SFM "
"在世界坐标系中规划，但速度未经变换直接传给机器人，导致背向目标的机器人越走越远；现在速度会先变换到机器人自身坐标系再执行。([#357](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/357))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:37
msgid ""
"**Lidar angle is clipped, not wrapped.** An `angle_range` or `fov` of 2\\*pi"
" was wrapped to 0, so every beam pointed forward; both are now clipped to "
"[0, 2\\*pi]. ([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"
msgstr ""
"**激光雷达角度改为截断而非取模。** `angle_range` 或 `fov` 为 2*pi 时会被取模成 0，所有光束指向正前方；二者现在都截断到"
" [0, 2*pi]。([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:38
msgid ""
"**The sampling interval is exact and never zero.** Floating-point noise made"
" 0.3 / 0.1 sample every 2 steps instead of 3, and `sample_time < step_time` "
"divided by zero; the ratio is now rounded before truncation and is at least "
"one step. ([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"
msgstr ""
"**采样间隔精确且不再为零。** 浮点噪声使 0.3 / 0.1 每 2 步而不是 3 步采样一次，`sample_time` 小于 "
"`step_time` 时还会除零；比率现在先舍入再截断，且至少为一步。([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/360))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:39
msgid ""
"**Actions match user expectations.** `env.step([1.0, 0.5])` split a flat "
"action over two objects and crashed, and `action_id` meant a list position "
"rather than an object; actions now accept flat lists, tuples, and dicts "
"keyed by robot name, `action_id` is the object id or name, surplus actions "
"are dropped with one warning, and an unknown id raises `ValueError`. "
"([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"
msgstr ""
"**动作行为符合用户预期。** `env.step([1.0, 0.5])` 会把扁平动作拆给两个对象并崩溃，`action_id` "
"表示列表位置而不是对象；现在接受扁平列表、元组以及以机器人名称为键的字典，`action_id` 是对象 id 或名称，多余动作丢弃并给出一次警告，未知"
" id 抛出 `ValueError`。([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:40
msgid ""
"**Unknown kinematics names raise.** A typo in `kinematics.name` silently "
"produced a differential-drive robot; it now raises `NotImplementedError`. "
"([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"
msgstr ""
"**未注册的运动学名称会抛出异常。** `kinematics.name` 拼写错误以前会静默生成差速机器人，现在抛出 "
"`NotImplementedError`。([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:41
msgid ""
"**Warnings stop flooding the log.** A clipped velocity or a robot without a "
"behavior warned on every step; such conditions now warn once and log later "
"occurrences at DEBUG level. ([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/360))"
msgstr ""
"**警告不再刷屏。** 速度被截断或机器人没有行为时，以前每一步都会警告；此类条件现在只警告一次，之后以 DEBUG "
"级别记录。([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:42
msgid ""
"**`end()` releases exactly its own resources.** Headless runs never closed "
"their figure, and cleanup closed other environments' windows and reset the "
"shared id counter; `end()` now closes only its own figure and leaves shared "
"state alone. ([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"
msgstr ""
"**`end()` 只释放自己的资源。** 无头运行从不关闭自己的图形，清理时还会关闭其他环境的窗口并重置共享 id 计数器；`end()` "
"现在只关闭自己的图形，不再改动共享状态。([#360](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/360))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:43
msgid ""
"**Object ids are per environment.** Creating or resetting a second "
"environment rewound the global id counter, so objects added to the first one"
" could reuse existing ids; each environment now numbers its objects from 0, "
"`add_object` rejects duplicates, objects compare by identity, and `env.id` "
"numbers environments. ([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/362))"
msgstr ""
"**对象 id 按环境分配。** 创建或重置第二个环境会回拨全局 id 计数器，导致添加到第一个环境的对象可能复用已有 id；每个环境现在从 0 "
"开始编号，`add_object` 拒绝重复 id，对象按身份比较，`env.id` "
"为环境编号。([#362](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/362))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:44
msgid ""
"**A global seed survives `make()`.** Creating an environment without a seed "
"used to replace the shared generator with a fresh unseeded one, so "
"`set_seed(0)` followed by `irsim.make()` was not reproducible. It is now. "
"([#365](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/365))"
msgstr ""
"**全局种子在 `make()` 之后仍然有效。** 以前创建不带种子的环境会用全新的无种子生成器替换共享生成器，因此先 `set_seed(0)` 再"
" `irsim.make()` 无法复现。现在可以了。([#365](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/365))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:45
msgid ""
"**Plot and keyboard edge cases are fixed.** Rectangles drawn from width and "
"height raised `TypeError` and sat off their collision geometry, a follow "
"viewpoint showed one world-center frame first, a 3D line accepted only three"
" points, and keys pressed without an environment raised; all of these now "
"work or are ignored with a warning. ([#356](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/356))"
msgstr ""
"**绘图与键盘的边界问题已修复。** 用宽和高绘制矩形会抛出 `TypeError` 且与碰撞几何错位，跟随视角会先显示一帧世界中心画面，3D "
"线段只接受三个点，没有环境时按键会抛错；这些现在要么正常工作，要么被忽略并给出警告。([#356](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/356))"

