#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:55
msgid ""
"Apply body-frame circle-center offsets consistently across collision "
"geometry, rendering, convex `G/h` constraints, and RVO neighbor state, and "
"clamp the HRVO inverse-sine input. Keeps offset and Ackermann circles "
"aligned across representations and prevents math-domain failures. "
"([#344](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/344))"
msgstr ""
"在碰撞几何、渲染、凸 `G/h` 约束和 RVO 邻居状态中一致应用机体坐标系下的圆心偏移，并对 HRVO "
"反正弦函数的输入进行截断。这样可确保带偏移的圆和阿克曼模型圆在各种表示中保持对齐，并避免数学定义域错误。([#344](https://github.com/hanruihua"
"/ir-sim/pull/344))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:58
msgid ""
"Extract object rendering from `ObjectBase` into a dedicated `ObjectPlot` "
"class and encapsulate plotting options in dataclasses while preserving the "
"public API and option precedence. Separates rendering responsibilities "
"without breaking existing callers. ([#345](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/345))"
msgstr ""
"将对象渲染从 `ObjectBase` 抽取到专用的 `ObjectPlot` 类，并用数据类封装绘图选项，同时保持公共 API "
"和选项优先级不变。这样可分离渲染职责，且不破坏现有调用方。([#345](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/345))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:61
msgid ""
"Move 17 documentation GIFs (~64 MB) to the dedicated IR-SIM-GIFs repository "
"and replace local paths with remote URLs. Keeps the source tree lightweight "
"without losing visual examples. ([#341](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/341))"
msgstr ""
"将 17 个文档 GIF（约 64 MB）迁移到专用的 IR-SIM-GIFs 仓库，并用远程 URL "
"替换本地路径。这样可在保留可视化示例的同时减小源码树体积。([#341](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/341))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:62
msgid ""
"Align usage and YAML documentation with runtime defaults, expand public API "
"docstrings, and improve API navigation in English and Chinese. Keeps "
"documented behavior and entry points consistent with the implementation. "
"([#343](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-sim/pull/343))"
msgstr ""
"使使用说明和 YAML 文档与运行时默认值保持一致，补充公共 API 文档字符串，并改进中英文 API "
"导航。这样可使文档中的行为和入口点与实现保持一致。([#343](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/pull/343))"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/changelog.md:63
msgid ""
"Refresh Chinese translation catalogs, clarify `world.status` semantics, "
"remove the undocumented `\"Done\"` value from the documented runtime-status "
"list, and upgrade Ruff to 0.16.0 with reformatted Markdown code blocks. "
